  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core SplitButtons package provides SplitButton and DropDownButton controls for building action menus in toolbars and UI panels. The SplitButton combines a primary action button with a dropdown menu of secondary actions. The DropDownButton provides a dropdown menu accessible through a button trigger. Both controls support icons, keyboard navigation, RTL, templates, separators, and accessibility compliance, making them ideal for toolbars, action panels, and command interfaces in ASP.NET Core applications.",
